      "id": "claim_2a9922446f9e449093118a97f21e59df",
      "statement": "HO 01 12 applies a deductible once to each covered windstorm or hail occurrence after covered direct physical loss is calculated, without creating coverage for an excluded cause or multiplying the deductible by damaged items; a deductible change requires the stated written notice, content, delivery, consent, effective-date, and prior-claim protections when applicable law requires them.",
